        <p>NOTlCE.—Solvers who become entitled tn a prize in this competition can, if they desire, have any book on the game of Draughts equal to the value of ss. instead of cash priz.., by notifying the Draughts Editor.</p>
        <p>In connection with the ablve competition we may state that we offer a monthly prize of 5s to the competitor who succeeds in placing himself at the bead of the Solvers' List at the end of the month. Where the prize is awarded the winner's score is Cancelled, while the remaining competitors' points go towards the next month',, competition. The win- ner may re-enter the competition if he chooses, commencing again at the bottom of the list. Points are awarded as follows : Two for the correct solu- tion of a problem, two for showing a dual solution, two for correcting the author's terms, and one for each minor correction.</p>
        <p>Intenling vmpetitors may com:nence at any time.</p>
